s、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:22.388Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","session_id":"b914204a-7e45-4d62-963a-f8ec502de9f2","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"46f81561-b1ff-4347-9798-af069f1f3f19","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"76f08bf6-3cdb-497c-89e9-b3f6dce18ee5","thread":"46f81561-b1ff-4347-9798-af069f1f3f19","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-76f08bf6-3cdb-497c-89e9-b3f6dce18ee5"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-q4rmio6o/state/worktrees/936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","base_commit":"bd2ff3d2078b843715388c09c05b6eb4b1d66f0a","card_snapshot_id":"49aad333-8766-4621-bf29-3666aa2ec1fd","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:23.587Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-q4rmio6o/repo","cat-file","-t","865de525ef8cf27ac1de9ad2abcc57f1142eda42"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-q4rmio6o/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:23.593Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-q4rmio6o/repo","cat-file","-t","865de525ef8cf27ac1de9ad2abcc57f1142eda42"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-q4rmio6o/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":22,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:23.593Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"936cb51b-a752-411b-950f-96b4d99fe3ae","type":